      "width": 5920,
      "height": 18.3,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Deterministic code confines the review path and refuses an empty finding list before any agent exists. Then F1 → F2 → F3 → F4 → F5 forward each exact text inside the operator's own launch checkout.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deterministic code confines the review path and refuses an empty finding list before any agent exists. Then F1 → F2 → F3 → F4 → F5 forward each exact text inside the operator's own launch checkout.",
